Sixteen-year-old Sarah is given thirteen hours to solve a labyrinth and rescue her baby brother Toby when her wish for him to be taken away is granted by the Goblin King Jareth.

Come out and make your voice heard by exercising your right to vote! &#x1F5F3;&#65039;

Polls will be open from 7 am to 8 pm, with voting located at the Exhibit Hall on the north side of the facility.

For more information visit https://www.weberelections.gov/

Time Onlys: 4pm&#160;
Races: 6:30pm

For more information and events:
www.facebook.com&#8230;

Join local expert, Rich Koski, as he takes you on a guided walk from Union Station to the Monarch Building in the Nine Rails Creative District.

Early Weber County and Ogden history including the role of the fur traders and mountain men establishing the first European-American settlement in Utah.&#160;

Among the historical facts and anecdotes provided by your guide you&#8217;ll learn about:&#160;

Arrival of the Mormon Pioneers and establishment of Ogden as an agricultural community.&#160;
Ogden&#8217;s emergence as the Crossroads of the West following the completion of the Transcontinental R

